      "content": "but even \"resting\" feels like too much work. i don't have anyone to talk to, nothing to do, no reason to wake up tomorrow. the world just keeps moving like i'm not even part of it. it's like i'm already gone, it's just my body that hasn't caught up yet. does it even matter if i'm here or not?",
